# Independent assortment

@left

![Independent assortment](assets/lect06c-meiosis/assortment_17.svg)

@right

- Chromosome alignment at metaphase I is random.
- This arrangement produces AB and ab.
- [Green]{color=green} + [orange]{color=orange}; [blue]{color=blue} + [red]{color=red}.
- Across both equally likely arrangements: AB : Ab : aB : ab = 1 : 1 : 1 : 1.

